<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ability Spells</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Mana: 20 each
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast strength &lt;target&gt;
cast dexterity &lt;target&gt;
cast constitution &lt;target&gt;
cast brain &lt;target&gt;
cast charisma &lt;target&gt;
(leave out the target to cast it on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Five spells that each raise one of the target's abilities for a while 
(see <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>):
</p>
<pre>strength       conjurer 10, sorcerer 10
dexterity      sorcerer 4, conjurer 6, assassin 30
constitution   sorcerer 6, conjurer 8
brain          conjurer 2, sorcerer 2
charisma       healer 6
</pre>
<p>(the guilds that teach each, with the guild level). Charisma draws on 
divine power, the other four on magic.
</p><p>The better the casting, the bigger the rise: about +10 for a good 
casting, a little more for a master's. It lasts at least ten minutes, and 
longer the better the casting. Each works once at a time: cast it again 
on someone who already has it, and the magic just dissipates. They are 
also found on potions, wands and scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Abilities</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Focus</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>